\f0\i0 .\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 23. Choose the appropriate determiner:
\f0\b0 \
\
There is __________ milk left in the jug; it is almost completely empty.\
\
(A) many\
\
(B) a few\
\
(C) little\
\
(D) several\
\

\f1\b Answer: (C) little.
\f0\b0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 Explanation:
\f0\i0  "Little" is used with uncountable nouns ("milk") to denote a negligible or almost zero quantity.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 24. Identify the type of the given sentence:
\f0\b0 \
\
"Please pass me the salt cellar from the counter."\
\
(A) Declarative\
\
(B) Interrogative\
\
(C) Imperative\
\
(D) Exclamatory\
\

\f1\b Answer: (C) Imperative.
\f0\b0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

