\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 25. Choose the correct prepositional collocation:
\f0\b0 \
\
Sneha is very fond __________ playing the violin.\
\
(A) in\
\
(B) of\
\
(C) with\
\
(D) at\
