\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 27. Fill in the blank with the correct possessive form:
\f0\b0 \
\
These are the __________ toys; please return them to their room.\
\
(A) childrens'\
\
(B) children's\
\
(C) childrens\
