\
(A) Tropical rainforests\
\
(B) Treeless Arctic tundra\
\
(C) Dense coniferous woods\
\
(D) Coastal sand dunes\
\

\f1\b Answer: (B) Treeless Arctic tundra.
\f0\b0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 Explanation:
\f0\i0  The first paragraph states it inhabits the "treeless tundra of the Arctic."\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

